-- the angular expansion (Legendre polynomials defined by Bonnet's recurrence (l+1)P_{l+1} = (2l+1)ηP_l − lP_{l−1}):
-- ηP_l = ((l+1)P_{l+1} + lP_{l−1})/(2l+1), so η²P_l = α_l P_{l+2} + β_l P_l + γ_l P_{l−2} with
-- α_l = (l+1)(l+2)/((2l+1)(2l+3)) and γ_l = l(l−1)/((2l−1)(2l+1)) read off directly, and
-- β_l = ((l+1)²/(2l+3) + l²/(2l−1))/(2l+1), which equals (2l²+2l−1)/((2l−1)(2l+3)) exactly when
-- (l+1)²(2l−1) + l²(2l+3) = (2l+1)(2l²+2l−1), a cubic identity in l: it holds at four points, so everywhere. With the
-- Legendre equation d/dη[(1−η²)P_l′] = −l(l+1)P_l, Y = Σ c_l P_l in d/dη[(1−η²)Y′] + (A + p²η²)Y = 0 gives, at P_l,
-- p²γ_{l+2} c_{l+2} + (A − l(l+1) + p²β_l) c_l + p²α_{l−2} c_{l−2} = 0: the angular recurrence H₂⁺'s certificate runs
sep-beta-at : BQ → Bool
sep-beta-at l = fn-eq (bq-add (bq-mul (bq-mul (bq-add l (fn-q 1 1)) (bq-add l (fn-q 1 1))) (fn-sub (bq-mul (fn-q 2 1) l) (fn-q 1 1))) (bq-mul (bq-mul l l) (bq-add (bq-mul (fn-q 2 1) l) (fn-q 3 1)))) (bq-mul (bq-add (bq-mul (fn-q 2 1) l) (fn-q 1 1)) (fn-sub (bq-add (bq-mul (fn-q 2 1) (bq-mul l l)) (bq-mul (fn-q 2 1) l)) (fn-q 1 1)))
